<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY FEB PPI UP 2.1 PCT M/M, UP 22.5 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY FEB PPI UP 2.1 PCT M/M, UP 22.5 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian producer prices in February rose 2.1 percent over January and rose 22.5 percent from February last year, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> PRODUCER PRICES	     Feb 97    Jan 97     Feb 96</p>
<p> Monthly change (pct)	 +2.1	+4.7	 +1.8</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (pct) +22.5     +22.2	+24.6</p>
<p>NOTE - In February domestic sales prices rose 2.1 percent</p>
<p>over January and were up 24.7 percent year-on-year, KSH said.</p>
<p>Meanwhile, export prices rose 1.7 percent month-on-month and</p>
<p>were 18.1 percent up year-on-year.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
